### Banking Transactions API — Sample Requests
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client extension and JetBrains HTTP Client.
### Run requests in order: seed transactions first, then read endpoints.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ─── Seed: Create Transactions ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Deposit 1000 USD into ACC-AA111
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### 2. Deposit 1000 UAH into ACC-AA111
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "UAH",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### 3. Transfer 250 USD from ACC-AA111 to ACC-BB222
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "toAccount": "ACC-BB222",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

###

### 4. Withdraw 50 USD from ACC-AA111
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "amount": 50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

###

# ─── Read: Transactions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5. List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

###

### 6. Filter by account
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-AA111

###

### 7. Filter by type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=deposit

###

### 8. Filter by date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

###

### 9. Filter combined: account + type
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-AA111&type=transfer

###

### 10. Get transaction by ID  (replace <id> with an actual id from response above)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/<id>

###

# ─── Read: Accounts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. Balance for ACC-AA111
### Expected: { "balances": { "USD": 700, "UAH": 1000 } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-AA111/balance

###

### 12. Balance for ACC-BB222
### Expected: { "balances": { "USD": 250 } }
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-BB222/balance

###

### 13. Summary for ACC-AA111
### Expected: totalDeposits { USD: 1000, UAH: 1000 }, totalWithdrawals { USD: 300 }, count: 4
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-AA111/summary

###

### 14. Simple interest — 5% annual rate for 30 days on ACC-AA111
### Expected: interest { USD: 2.88, UAH: 4.11 }
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-AA111/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

###

# ─── Validation Errors ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 15. Missing required fields → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 16. Invalid account format → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "bad-format",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### 17. Invalid currency → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "XYZ",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### 18. Negative amount → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "amount": -50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### 19. fromAccount on deposit (forbidden) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-AA111",
  "toAccount": "ACC-BB222",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

###

### 20. Invalid accountId format on balance route → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/not-an-account/balance

###

### 21. Unknown account → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-ZZZZZ/balance

###

### 22. Invalid interest params → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-AA111/interest?rate=0.05abc&days=30

###

### 23. Malformed date filter → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=not-a-date

###
